    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L16-ACTIVITY-013",
      "SourceSection": "16.2: Bacteria in Different Conditions",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Is there any positive value of \\(t\\) so that \\(f(t) =g(t)\\)? Explain how you know.",
