    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L16-ACTIVITY-017",
      "SourceSection": "16.3: Populations of Two Countries",
      "SourceExcerpt": "At some point in time, the population of Country C reached 30 million. When does this happen? Explain or show your reasoning.",
