    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L16-ACTIVITY-018",
      "SourceSection": "16.3: Populations of Two Countries",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Graphs representing functions can help us visualize how two or more quantities are changing in a situation. Let’s consider the populations of two colonies of ants.",
